{"3424760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GunX - Lock and Load", "steam_appid": 3424760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8b5132f5b3f91403e4a24a9e865a1bfd.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GunX: Build Fast. Shoot Faster. Survive the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX is a fast-paced VR shooter built around <strong>precision gun assembly</strong>, high-pressure combat, and intense multiplayer duels. Every fight begins with gun parts and your ability to put a weapon together before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap parts into place, rack the slide, load your magazine, and unleash chaos in <strong>PvP</strong>, <strong>Zombie campaign</strong>, or master the weapon in <strong>Shooting Range</strong>. Whether you’re battling players across the world or fighting back-to-back with a friend against waves of the undead, GunX keeps your adrenaline spiking from the moment you enter the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online PvP (Duels)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round begins with a <i>random weapon</i> that both players must assemble from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fast, load up, and eliminate your opponent to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of bullets? That mistake might cost you the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First player to win <strong>best of 3 rounds</strong> claims victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie Mode (Singleplayer/Co-Op)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against relentless waves of zombies in an action-packed campaign.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with basic weapons and gradually unlock stronger guns and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow wilder, faster, and deadlier as the campaign progresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special tools like <strong>Molotovs</strong>, <strong>Pipe Bombs</strong>, and <strong>Shields</strong> to control the chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/c968125e924f2ba622c5d3ed0ab031b5.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play the entire Zombie campaign with a friend in 2-player co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player gets their own assembly desk and resources to manage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With in game voice chat, coordinate, split tasks, cover each other… and survive together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why you will Love GunX</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely <strong>unique VR mechanic</strong>: assemble guns under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, skill-based PvP duels that reward true mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full co-op campaign for unforgettable zombie survival sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A satisfying gameplay loop built on improving speed, precision, and efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth VR interactions with realistic weapon handling and physics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX isn’t just another VR shooter — it’s a <strong>test of skill, speed, and nerves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/567e4cc77b8b2aeac9379e9747f79df9.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8b5132f5b3f91403e4a24a9e865a1bfd.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GunX: Build Fast. Shoot Faster. Survive the Impossible</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GunX is a fast-paced VR shooter built around <strong>precision gun assembly</strong>, high-pressure combat, and intense multiplayer duels. Every fight begins with gun parts and your ability to put a weapon together before anyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/1dd64684a333a58bf776ac38122a9fe3.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap parts into place, rack the slide, load your magazine, and unleash chaos in <strong>PvP</strong>, <strong>Zombie campaign</strong>, or master the weapon in <strong>Shooting Range</strong>. Whether you’re battling players across the world or fighting back-to-back with a friend against waves of the undead, GunX keeps your adrenaline spiking from the moment you enter the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online PvP (Duels)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/4e1e20a2b1b65401309452f1ef8ba094.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round begins with a <i>random weapon</i> that both players must assemble from scratch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fast, load up, and eliminate your opponent to score points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of bullets? That mistake might cost you the match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First player to win <strong>best of 3 rounds</strong> claims victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Zombie Mode (Singleplayer/Co-Op)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.poster.avif?t=1774064286\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.webm?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424760/extras/8da2655bc64a9fd3295ffad756e60762.mp4?t=1774064286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=